1:["$","$Ld",null,{"reaction":{"id":"carbon","formula":"¹²C(α,γ)¹⁶O","tag":["碳与氧的起源","The origin of carbon and oxygen"],"title":["碳氧丰度与恒星氦燃烧","Carbon, oxygen and stellar helium burning"],"text":["氦燃烧阶段，碳核俘获一个 α 粒子，生成氧核并释放 γ 射线。这一反应与三 α 过程共同影响氦燃烧结束时碳与氧的相对丰度，影响大质量恒星的演化及其最终命运。","During helium burning, carbon captures an alpha particle to form oxygen and emit a gamma ray. Together with the triple-alpha process, this reaction influences the carbon-to-oxygen ratio after helium burning and influences the evolution and final fate of massive stars."],"task":["在低能区直接测量极小的反应截面，为恒星模型提供实验约束。","Directly measure tiny cross sections at low energies to constrain stellar models."],"type":["氦燃烧","Helium burning"],"product":"¹⁶O + γ","input":"¹²C + α","particle":"γ","tone":"blue","publicProgress":["研究目标是在更低能区直接测量反应截面，结合反应模型改进恒星反应率约束。","The programme aims to measure cross sections at lower energies and improve stellar-rate constraints together with reaction modelling."],"detector":["探测俘获反应发出的 γ 射线；结合高效率探测、屏蔽与本底抑制提取微弱信号。","Measure capture gamma rays with efficient detectors, shielding and background rejection to identify weak signals."],"references":["juna-platform-review-2025"]}}]
